  "translation": "Yisrayɛl ka bɛɛ, sabu masakɛ ma u mɛn, jama ye ⟨את⟩ masakɛ lasɔ ko: An tɛ yɔrɔ si yen Dawida (Dawuda) fɛ; kelegu si tɛ an ye Yishay (Ishay) denkɛ fɛ. Yisrayɛl, o kɛ i ka tantiw! Sisan, i y'i ka so ɲɛ, Dawida! Yisrayɛl ka bɛɛ taara u ka tantiw la.",
